{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:33477323\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接研究PD冻结步态的预测与识别，可为FOG行为表型和客观测量方法提供参考，但未涉及STN神经活动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:33489083\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究帕金森病精神病性症状及匹马万色林治疗，与STN神经活动和FOG无直接关联。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:33490655\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究基底节钙化导致的帕金森样病理表现，与目标研究问题无直接关联。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:33498513\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究ADORA2A和CYP1A2基因多态性与PD发病风险的关系，不涉及STN活动或FOG。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:33501179\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究可穿戴机器人触觉刺激对PD患者步态的影响，但未涉及FOG或STN神经活动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:33503872\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"综述肉毒神经毒素在帕金森病中的应用，与STN神经活动及冻结步态机制无直接关联。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:33505591\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究鹿茸提取物对PD动物模型氧化应激和神经炎症的作用，与STN-FOG关系无关。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:33505652\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究FOG的临床危险因素及认知、运动并发症之间的交互作用，可帮助识别STN神经活动与FOG关系研究中的临床混杂因素。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:33510266\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究rTMS对反眼跳和PIGD的影响，虽涉及步态功能及脑网络，但没有FOG或STN神经活动的直接证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:33517030\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接比较PD伴与不伴FOG患者的步态启动和预期姿势调整，可为FOG运动学表型及竞争性机制解释提供参考。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:33522500\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究遗传性PD大鼠模型的步态分析方法，没有涉及FOG或STN神经活动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:33523016\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究REM睡眠肌张力缺失与PD步态障碍的关系，没有涉及FOG或STN神经活动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:33523020\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"综述可穿戴传感器监测PD运动症状的方法，可能包含FOG的客观评估及测量方法，但不涉及STN电生理机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:33523872\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究无线深部脑刺激及局部STN调控对神经活动和行为的影响，可提供STN神经调控的交叉机制证据，但未研究PD冻结步态。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:33526049\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究PD患者单任务和双任务步行中的运动学规律性，没有涉及FOG或STN神经活动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:33532136\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"综述身体活动改善PD症状的机制，研究重点不是FOG或STN神经活动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:33535176\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究PD患者生存预测模型，与FOG及STN神经活动无关。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:33539481\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"系统综述PD患者居家步态及运动症状监测，可作为FOG客观评估和行为表型测量的补充资料，但未涉及STN神经活动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:33540570\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究可穿戴设备检测PD患者上肢震颤和运动迟缓，与FOG及STN神经活动无直接关系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:33540883\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"综述心理意象在PD康复中的应用，虽然涉及步态和平衡，但没有针对FOG或STN神经活动的证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:33547085\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究丘脑Pf-STN投射对运动启动及多巴胺耗竭动物运动障碍的影响，可为STN参与运动启动和冻结相关机制提供重要的交叉证据，但未直接研究FOG。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:33547309\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"提供PD患者可穿戴加速度计数据集，主要用于运动症状及药物波动评估，没有STN活动或FOG的直接研究内容。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:33547311\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究PD患者基底节和中脑血管周围间隙负荷与临床症状的关系，不涉及STN神经活动或FOG机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:33547317\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"提供PD患者肢体和躯干可穿戴加速度计数据集，重点是运动症状和药物波动，并非STN-FOG研究。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:33547846\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究α-突触核蛋白在嗅球起始的病理扩散及非运动症状，与STN神经活动和FOG无直接关联。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:33549721\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接记录PD患者STN局部场电位并研究DBS诱发的精细调谐γ振荡，可作为STN神经活动特征及药物、刺激状态影响的关键电生理参考，但未分析FOG。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:33549914\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"讨论PD运动并发症居家监测所需的临床可操作信息，可能为FOG行为结局的监测和评估提供方法学参考，但摘要缺失且未显示STN相关内容。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:33553487\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"系统综述PD不同运动亚型的神经影像学差异，涉及PIGD及纹状体-丘脑-皮质环路，可为FOG相关网络机制及患者异质性提供间接证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:33559531\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接研究PD冻结步态的认知、边缘及感觉运动机制，并通过随机交叉干预验证不同机制的作用，可为解释STN-FOG关联研究中的机制冲突提供重要竞争性假说。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:33561987\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究健康人群节律刺激对步态变异性的影响，没有PD、FOG或STN神经活动相关证据。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f6447ff7-1714-4273-b688-e563f9cbc45b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T144118900692Z", "elapsed_seconds": 86.297, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T14:42:45.220667+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6635d598ed9b0d352f4c3d97e4f241640d98b86d225e387ca6d382de91fd41ad", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T144118900692Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "b1d3a7893514dfa139ab158fc99f81a921a980a9e8e1eae05f8e1cc0b8e3e8c6"}}}
